<h1>Z System - Close-Up</h1>
<hr align="center" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>Each picture indicates a cabling connection between one of the components of the system.</p>
<p class="sub-head"><span lang="EN-GB"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><a name="MMIB"></a>MMIB-DL connections</b></span></p>
<table class="MsoNormalTable" style="border-spacing:5px;" cellspacing="5">
<col>
<col>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs4">
<td class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-GB"><img id="_x0000_i1026" src="p9_mmib_dl_front_and_cables.jpg" width="442px" height="305px" border="0" class="img_whs6" alt=""></span>&#160;</b></p>
</td>
<td class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table">The sensor cable transfers data from the senor. &#160;The trigger cable provides a synchronisation signal to the localiser. &#160;The antenna receives the signal from the remote switches.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs7">
<td class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-GB"><img id="_x0000_i1027" src="p9_mmib_dl_rear_and_cables.jpg" width="455px" height="406px" border="0" class="img_whs8" alt=""></span>&#160;</b></p>
</td>
<td class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table">The power cable provides power from either mains or battery. &#160;The MMIB-DL I/O cable transmit data to/from the PC.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs9">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs5">
<p class="sub-head"><a name="PC"></a>Laptop PC Connections</p>
<p class="normal-table"><img src="28_june_pcmcia_insert.jpg" width="418px" height="320px" border="0" class="img_whs10" alt=""></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table">The PCMCIA card is plugged in to a PCMCIA slot and the I/O cable connects it with the MMIB-DL.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs9">
<td class="whs5">
<p class="sub-head">Desktop PC connections</p>
<p class="normal-table"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-GB"><img id="_x0000_i1028" src="PCI_cable.JPG" width="295px" height="137px" border="0" class="img_whs11" alt=""></span>&#160;</b></p>
</td>
<td class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table">The PCI card is plugged into any available PCI slot and the I/O cable connects it with the MMIB-DL.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs12">
<td class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:12.0pt;"><font size="3" style="font-size:12pt;">&#160;</font></span><img src="USB_cable.JPG" width="284px" height="146px" border="0" class="img_whs13" alt=""></p>
</td>
<td class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table">(FARO USB Arm) The localiser USB cable provides the link to the localiser.</p>
<p class="normal-table">A dongle controls the software options.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs14">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><img src="p10_PC_serial_and_dongle_and_PCI.jpg" width="181px" height="250px" border="0" class="img_whs15" alt=""></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table">(CimCore) A serial connection provides communication for the localilser.</p>
<p class="normal-table">Here a parallel port dongle is shown</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs14">
<td class="whs5">
<p class="sub-head"><a name="Sensor"></a>Sensor connection</p>
<p class="normal-table">&#160;</p>
</td>
<td class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table">The sensor cable transfers data from the sensor to the MMIB-DL.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs16">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><img src="p10_Z_on_cimcore.jpg" width="299px" height="228px" border="0" class="img_whs17" alt=""></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table">&#160;</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs16">
<td class="whs5">
<p class="sub-head"><a name="Arm"></a>Arm connections</p>
<p class="normal-table"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-GB"><img id="_x0000_i1031" src="FARO_arm_base_conns.jpg" width="275px" height="374px" border="0" class="img_whs18" alt=""></span>&#160;</b></p>
</td>
<td class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table">(FARO USB Arm) The trigger cable is connected from the MMIB-DL to the localiser trigger port (miniDIN connector).</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs19">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><img src="cimcore_rear.jpg" width="280px" height="205px" border="0" class="img_whs20" alt=""></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table">(Cimcore) &#160;The trigger cable is connected from the MMIB-DL to the localiser trigger port (DB9 connector)</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs19">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table"><img src="USB_dongle.JPG" width="130px" height="72px" border="0" class="img_whs21" alt=""></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table">USB dongle.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs19">
<td class="whs5">
<p class="sub-head"><span lang="EN-GB">Dongle parallel port version&#160;</span></p>
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="dongle.JPG" width="250px" height="79px" border="0" class="img_whs22" alt=""></span></p>
</td>
<td class="whs5">
<p class="normal-table">Parallel port dongle</p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
